<title>UK: Key points from BCC quarterly UK economic survey.</title>
<headline>Key points from BCC quarterly UK economic survey.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the key findings from the British Chambers of Commerce (BCC) economic survey for the second quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>The BCC survey covers 9,052 British companies in both services and manufacturing.</p>
<p>All figures are expressed as a percentage balance, except categories asterisked, which show a pure percentage.</p>
<p>						 Q2 1997     Q1 1997</p>
<p>MANUFACTURING</p>
<p>Were domestic deliveries</p>
<p> up over the past 3 months?	     22	     20</p>
<p>Were export deliveries up</p>
<p> over the past 3 months?		  13	     20</p>
<p>Were export orders up over</p>
<p> the past three months?		    4	     16</p>
<p>Do you expect to increase</p>
<p> workforce in the next 3 months?	14	     16</p>
<p>Have you experienced difficulties</p>
<p> in recruiting staff in last 3 mths?* 67	     72</p>
<p>Have you revised up investment</p>
<p>plans for plant and machinery</p>
<p> in past three months?		    22	     25</p>
<p>Will turnover improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			    53	     55</p>
<p>Will profitability improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			    35	     45</p>
<p>Is your firm operating at</p>
<p> full capacity?*			    32	     33</p>
<p>Has your cash flow improved in</p>
<p> the last three months?		   15		8</p>
<p>SERVICES</p>
<p>Were domestic deliveries</p>
<p> up over the past 3 mths?		 40	     38</p>
<p>Were export deliveries up</p>
<p> over the past 3 months?		  21	     22</p>
<p>Were export orders up over</p>
<p> the past three months?		    6	     13</p>
<p>Do you expect to increase</p>
<p> workforce in the next 3 mths?	  26	     25</p>
<p>Have you experienced difficulties</p>
<p> in recruiting staff in last 3 mths?* 62	     66</p>
<p>Have you revised up investment</p>
<p>plans for plant and machinery</p>
<p> in past three months?		    28	     28</p>
<p>Will turnover improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			    62	     58</p>
<p>Will profitability improve in</p>
<p> next 12 months?			    45	     47</p>
<p>Is your firm operating at</p>
<p> full capacity?*			    39	     41</p>
<p>Has your cash flow improved in</p>
<p> the last three months?		   20	     16</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
